  (text "Input: WAGO J1 from a PDH/PDP breaker slot (10-20 A).  Q3 = low-side reverse-polarity FET, D1 = 16 V TVS." (at 20 32 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 6fe1a7d2-646d-4e2a-8c70-3e19a7a36c12))
  (text "Buck leg uses external FETs Q1/Q2; boost leg FETs are inside U1." (at 160 32 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 82c35e37-36a6-4795-a9b6-56410374bdc7))
  (text "UVLO rising = 1.23 V x (1 + R3/R4) = 5.5 V    FSW: R5 49.9k = 400 kHz    ILIM: R9 22.1k = 14.9 A avg    MODE: tied to GND = internal LDO, forced PWM" (at 60 105 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 98e6f0d9-8fc0-4e91-abd0-a11e7c4b8d8a))
  (text "VOUT = 1.2 V x (1 + R6/R7) = 12.1 V.   ISP/ISN tied to VOUT (output current sense unused).   PG, CC_N, CDC not used." (at 60 205 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 671c3b67-c7cc-4340-8ccd-e9df6b667264))
  (text "Output: to Linovision POE-Switch0504GDF PWR1 (DC 9-57 V).  At 12 V input the switch's PoE budget is 60 W." (at 255 105 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 7250e37f-2787-40ca-a364-fb8c3ea10ec0))
